    {
      "id": "claim_f56714450069430a8bdac9f1f411016d",
      "statement": "A cold activation runs the takeover recovery gate (`Effect::RecoverNodeLog`) for a non-sealed open prior-owner session: it fences the record with a CAS, seals the reachable followers, uploads retained segments and bundles, and only then marks the record sealed; the activation cannot restore before this completes.",
